STEPS TO RUN CODE
1. In main.c, specify planet_scenario file (all stored in scenario_library)
2. Compile code via gcc -o main main.c
3. Run code via ./main
Outputs are stored in the scenario libary subdirectory that also holds the planet_scenario and species_scenario files.


